ries no weight. No traffic advisory is on file: EV-ADVIS-02813-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0 with issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT, so POL-RD-03 cannot be run and the statement neither reduces the excess nor supplies an amended optimal; the assertion is discarded and the absence of any advisory is recorded. The chat log (EV-CHAT-02813) carries 0 messages, so POL-RD-04 is unavailable and no distance is excluded on that ground. No pickup or dropoff amendment appears on the trip record (all amendment fields null), so POL-RD-05 does not apply. The vehicle type is RYDE_X and solo_optimal_distance_km is null, so POL-RD-12's pooled baseline is not in issue. The fare breakdown carries no phantom gantry line and no wrongly applied surcharge, so no POL-RD-09(4) billing-integrity correction or referral arises. The rider's profile (deviation_claims_60d 0) does not trigger the POL-RD-08 corroboration uplift, and the driver's profile (deviation_flags_90d 0 over 260 completed trips in 90 days) does not establish a pattern; the lifetime counter prior_deviation_flags is context only under POL-GEN-01 and grounds nothing.\n\nConfidence rests on EV-FARE-02813, EV-GPS-02813 and EV-TRIP-02813, every one at weight 1.0; the missing advisory at weight 0.0 carries no deciding fact and does not drag the cap. No POL-RD-10 escalation trigger fires. The monetary effect of SGD 6.80 is below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold, so under POL-GEN-05 it executes automatically on issue. This ruling is provisional and made without human review; either party may appeal under POL-GEN-04 within 30 days."
  },
