      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-02813-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
